{
  "pageKey": "crm_lead_pool_recycle_rule_list",
  "name:zh-CN": "线索池回收规则",
  "name:en": "Lead Pool Recycle Rules",
  "modelCode": "crm_lead_pool_recycle_rule",
  "kind": "list",
  "schemaVersion": 4,
  "layout": { "type": "grid", "cols": 12 },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "crm_lprr_toolbar",
      "blockType": "toolbar",
      "buttons": [
        { "code": "create", "primary": true, "permissionCode": "crm.lead_pool.manage", "label": { "zh-CN": "新增回收条件", "en": "Add Recycle Condition" }, "action": { "type": "navigate", "to": "crm_lead_pool_recycle_rule_form" } },
        { "code": "back_to_pools", "label": { "zh-CN": "返回线索池设置", "en": "Back to Lead Pools" }, "action": { "type": "navigate", "to": "crm_lead_pool_list" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "crm_lprr_guidance",
      "blockType": "description",
      "content": {
        "zh-CN": "<h3>组合式自动回收</h3><p>一条记录代表一个时间条件。同一线索池按池策略中的“全部满足（AND）/任一满足（OR）”组合生效条件；没有组合条件时继续使用兼容回收天数，无需迁移开发数据。</p>",
        "en": "<h3>Composed automatic recycle</h3><p>Each record is one time condition. Active conditions for a pool use its ALL (AND) or ANY (OR) policy. Pools without composed conditions retain the compatible recycle-day policy, with no development-data migration required.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "crm_lprr_table",
      "blockType": "table",
      "columns": [
        { "field": "crm_lprr_name", "width": 200, "sortable": true },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_pool_id", "width": 180 },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_time_source", "width": 170, "renderType": "tag", "dictCode": "crm_lead_recycle_time_source" },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_operator", "width": 160, "renderType": "tag", "dictCode": "crm_lead_recycle_time_operator" },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_days", "width": 100, "align": "right" },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_start_at", "width": 180 },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_end_at", "width": 180 },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_status", "width": 100, "renderType": "tag", "dictCode": "crm_lead_recycle_rule_status" },
        { "field": "crm_lprr_sort_order", "width": 100, "align": "right", "sortable": true },
        {
          "field": "actions", "isActionColumn": true, "label": "$i18n:common.actions",
          "buttons": [
            { "code": "view", "label": "$i18n:common.button.view", "action": { "type": "navigate", "to": "crm_lead_pool_recycle_rule_detail" } },
            { "code": "edit", "permissionCode": "crm.lead_pool.manage", "label": "$i18n:common.button.edit", "action": { "type": "navigate", "to": "crm_lead_pool_recycle_rule_form" } },
            { "code": "delete", "danger": true, "permissionCode": "crm.lead_pool.manage", "label": "$i18n:common.button.delete", "confirm": { "zh-CN": "删除后该条件不再参与自动回收，确认继续？", "en": "This condition will no longer participate in automatic recycle. Continue?" }, "action": { "type": "command" } }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "searchFields": ["crm_lprr_code", "crm_lprr_name"],
      "defaultSort": { "field": "crm_lprr_sort_order", "order": "asc" }
    }
  ]
}
